/// M03 CORE-010 "bundled collections: assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/collections_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledCollections.
/// Related fixtures: std/map/current/src/main.can (ground for every root
/// pin below: sample 1, sets 1, main 1, absent 1, changed 5, alias 1,
/// set_operations 4, bool_keys 1, reference 1, fixture 1, folded 1,
/// mapped_entries 1 = 19 roots).
/// Disposition: MIGRATE (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 19 roots grounded per function in main.can.
/// Collection semantics (immutable copy, nominal keys, forged/revoked
/// rejection, set order/equality, atomic bulk) live in
/// core-010-collections-semantics.can; the run output/status shape and
/// silent production entry live in core-010-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: main 19 roots; duplicate bulk key, forged token, revoked
/// backing, intersection branches.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec, CAN_TSC optional with
/// CAN_BUN; requires can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-008 (runtime/test/collections.test.ts, 10
/// declarations; recorded, not executed; old pass-count spellings need
/// current-contract relevance review).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QN2; both UNMET).
/// Case bundled/collections-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, sample-roots, sets-roots, main-roots,
/// absent-roots, changed-roots, alias-roots, setops-roots, boolkeys-roots,
/// reference-roots, fixture-roots, folded-roots, mapped-roots.
/// Facet map (collections_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L80-83: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L84-87: passed true, 19 assertions); fixture-name grounds the 19
/// roots in main.can (L71-79: fixture "main" staged as src/main.can);
/// sample-roots pins sample (main.can L4-13: ordered L7 => ok [entry 3,
/// entry 2]); sets-roots pins sets (L14-23: sample L17 => ok true via
/// intersection contains); main-roots pins main (L24-46: sample L29: [] =>
/// ok via alias/folded); absent-roots pins absent (L47-54: sample L50 =>
/// key_absent); changed-roots pins changed (L55-83: L60-64 replacement,
/// removal, duplicate, absent_replace, absent_remove); alias-roots pins
/// alias (L84-95: sample L87 => ok "original" after replace);
/// setops-roots pins set_operations (L96-116: L101-104 union, difference,
/// original, empty); boolkeys-roots pins bool_keys (L117-124: sample L120
/// => ok true); reference-roots pins reference (L125-133: sample L128 =>
/// ok true via callables); fixture-roots pins fixture (L134-143: sample
/// L137 => ok "fixture" via when override); folded-roots pins folded
/// (L144-150: sample L147 => ok true via fold add); mapped-roots pins
/// mapped_entries (L151-156: sample L154 => ok [[]] via map entries).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
